#. <CLT 4>中には…ほとんど何も
#. 入ってないみたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This thing is practically empty.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>手帳が１冊だけポツンと置いてある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's just one thing—some kind of pocketbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>名前は書いてないみたいだ。
#. これじゃあ、誰が残した手帳かわからないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see a name written on it, so I can't say for\n"
"sure whose it is.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも…中に何が書いてあるのか…
#. 気になるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But there's some writing inside. It could be\n"
"important.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …持ち主には悪いけど、
#. ちょっと確認させてもらうか…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I don't like violating the owner's privacy, but I'd\n"
"better take a look."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>手帳に書かれている文字は、
#. 女の子のものみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like a girl's handwriting...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、すべての文字が
#. 測ったように等間隔に書き込まれている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And all the letters are spaced out evenly, like\n"
"whoever wrote them was measuring them.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>かなり、几帳面な性格みたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Whoever wrote this must have been really meticulous.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこで、手帳をめくっていたボクの手を
#. 止めたのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I was flipping through the pocketbook, but my hand\n"
"froze when I got to a certain page.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの聞き覚えのある…言葉の数々だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I saw something familiar written there, words I'd\n"
"heard before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 希望ヶ峰学園をシェルター化し、
#. 生徒達に共同生活を送らせる計画…
msgctxt "0012 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"\"There's a plan to turn Hope's Peak into a shelter,\n"
"and isolate the students here in a communal life.\""
msgstr ""

#. 私は、その計画について、
#. 発案者である人物に直接、話を聞く事にした。
msgctxt "0013 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"\"I decided to talk to the one who came up with the\n"
"plan directly.\""
msgstr ""

#. 私の父でもある…希望ヶ峰学園長に……
msgctxt "0014 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"\"It just so happens to be the headmaster—and my\n"
"father.\""
msgstr ""

#. すると、彼から次の回答を得る事が出来た。
msgctxt "0015 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"\"He was willing to give me some more details regarding\n"
"the plan. Here's what he said...\""
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>『天才たちを保護し、未来への希望とする事が、
#. 　この計画の目的なのだ。』
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"The point is to keep our student prodigies safe, to\n"
"keep them as our hope for the future.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>『天災に勝つのは天才だけ…
#. 　そして、絶望に勝てるのは希望だけだ。』
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"Only their genius can overcome disaster, and only\n"
"their hope can overcome despair.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>『この計画は、我が国にとって、
#. 　最後の希望と言っても過言ではない…』
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"For the future of our country, our world, it's not an\n"
"exaggeration to call this our final hope.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>『優秀な若者を汚れた世界から隔離し、
#. 　未来への礎としなければならないのだ。』
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"We must isolate our superior youth from the corrupted\n"
"world, to serve as the foundation for a new era.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>『それこそが唯一の希望…
#. 　その為に、お前にも協力してもらいたい。』
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"This is the only hope we have. I hope that you'll be\n"
"willing to go along with this plan...\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …それが父の言葉だった。
msgctxt "0021 | NO NAME"
msgid "\"So that's what my father had to say to me.\""
msgstr ""

#. 相変わらず、自分勝手に物事を決めて…
msgctxt "0022 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"\"As usual, he made a selfish decision without\n"
"consulting anyone else.\""
msgstr ""

#. 本当に最低な父親…
msgctxt "0023 | NO NAME"
msgid "\"I can't imagine a worse father.\""
msgstr ""

#. ウソ…だろ…？
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This...can't be true, can it?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その手帳の持ち主…
#. それは、もう明らかだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I knew it was. And I knew exactly who the\n"
"pocketbook belonged to.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さん…彼女以外には考えられない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko... It couldn't be anyone else.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でも…霧切さんの物だったとしても…
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But if this belongs to Kyoko..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうして、そんな物が…
#. このロッカーの中に？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...what was it doing in this locker?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、この手帳に書かれていた内容は、
#. 今まで彼女から聞いていた話とは食い違っている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And what she wrote here completely contradicts what\n"
"she already told me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんは、幼い頃に別れて以来、
#. お父さんとは会ってないって言ってたのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She said she hasn't seen her dad since he left when\n"
"she was little.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私は、その計画について、
#. 発案者である人物に直接、話を聞く事にした。
msgctxt "0031 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"\"I decided to talk to the one who came up with the\n"
"plan directly.\""
msgstr ""

#. 私の父でもある…希望ヶ峰学園長に…
msgctxt "0032 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"\"It just so happens to be the headmaster—and my\n"
"father.\""
msgstr ""

#. どういう…事だよ…！
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What does this all mean...!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、手にした手帳を慌しくめくっていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I quickly scanned the remaining pages of the notebook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>頭の中の疑問を消し去ってくれる“何か”を
#. 探すように…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I must have been looking for something that would\n"
"prove me wrong about this whole thing.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると、その手帳の最後のページで、
#. ボクの頭の中のクエスチョンマークは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But when I reached the last page, the question marks\n"
"spinning through my mind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…さらに、大きく膨れ上がった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...just started spinning that much faster.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこにあったのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When I looked at it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それまでの几帳面な字とは打って変わり、
#. まるで殴り書きされたような文章で…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Unlike the rest of the pocketbook, the writing here\n"
"was messy, disorganized, scrawled.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なんだ…これ……？
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What is this...?"
msgstr ""

#. どういう意味だよ…？
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What does it mean?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、意味なんてわからない…
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I have no idea..."
msgstr ""

#. わかる訳がないよ…
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "How could this possibly make any sense?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>ロッカールームで見つけた手帳<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Locker Pocketbook<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>手帳が１冊だけポツンと置いてある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's just one thing—some kind of pocketbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>名前は書いてないみたいだ。
#. これじゃあ、誰が残した手帳かわからない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see a name written on it, so I can't say for\n"
"sure whose it is.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、書かれている中身から、
#. 持ち主は霧切さん…以外には考えられない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But based on what's written inside, the owner can't be\n"
"anyone other than...Kyoko.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だけど…霧切さんの物だったとしても…
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But if this belongs to Kyoko..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうして、そんな物が…
#. この…ロッカーの中に？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...what was it doing in this locker?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、この手帳に書かれていた内容は、
#. 今まで彼女から聞いていた話とは食い違っている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And what she wrote here completely contradicts what\n"
"she already told me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんは、幼い頃に別れた以来、
#. お父さんとは会ってないって言ってたはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She said she hasn't seen her dad since he left when\n"
"she was little.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、不可解なのはそれだけじゃない…
#. この手帳の最後のページ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And more than that, the last page of the pocketbook...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 意味が…わからない…
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I just don't understand it at all."
msgstr ""
